## DeepSeek Provider

DeepSeek support is wired through the OpenAI-compatible client.

Defaults:
- provider: deepseek
- base_url: https://api.deepseek.com
- model: deepseek-v4-flash
- key source: DEEPSEEK_API_KEY or ~/deepseek_key

If the API returns an insufficient balance error, the integration is reaching DeepSeek successfully; add credits before further testing.
